@0 = ~So I am to believe you are a human *noble*, as it were, Drake? I'm unconvinced.~
@1 = ~You are hardly the first, lady pointy-ears. My family was once of common birth. For my part, I find the whole 'nobility' concept to be pretentious.~
@2 = ~It is Lady Vienxay Starlight, not "pointy-ears", human. Unlike you, I demand respect and hold myself with dignity.~
@3 = ~Dignity, eh? What's this about exile I hear, then?~
@4 = ~Over a misunderstanding. An error that will be corrected.~
@5 = ~Is that so? I suppose it is your right to seek justice against this murderer that made you their scapegoat, then... *If* you truly are innocent, that is.~
@6 = ~Hrmph. Of course I am innocent. Still, I suppose you are more tolerable than most humans.~
@7 = ~Ha! I've heard that one more than a few times as well. We'll see if it comes to last.~
